# Frontend Environment Variables
# If deploying together via Docker / Nginx reverse proxy, leave both empty (defaults to same-origin /api and /ws/p2p)
# If deploying frontend separately (e.g. Vercel, Netlify, Cloudflare Pages), point to your hosted backend:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/api
# VITE_WS_URL=wss://api.yourdomain.com/ws/p2p
